{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"新年あけましておめでとうございます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様の新しい年が幸せな一年になりますように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"突然ですがここで問題です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2017/01/05/1832617/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"問題:どちらがみり愛でしょうか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"答えられた方にはするめ1年分差し上げます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紅白の時の、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2017/01/05/1832617/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紅白後、お兄からさっそく連絡がきて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"兄「みり愛だけ靴履いてなかっただろ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり「履いてたわ！！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"兄「え、みんなと同じ靴履いてたのにあんなちびなの？うわ〜〜」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結論:私へのお年玉増額決定"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい（＾ω＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2017/01/05/1832617/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほらちゃんと素敵な靴履いてます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衣装すべてお気に入りです〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年明けには、\n家族旅行に行ってまいりました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2017/01/05/1832617/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夕食を食べている時に\nお誕生日の方にサプライズで\nケーキと打上げ花火のプレゼントがあり、\n店員さんのおもてなしと優しさに\n思わず涙が出てしまいました...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日のでもないのになぜ私が。笑\n最近涙腺がかなり弱くて、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてノンアルコールカクテル\nというものに挑戦してみました。\n美味しい、はまりました！\n3杯おかわりしちゃいましたよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\" カシス × ジンジャーエール \""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こーれが美味しいんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年の抱負、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までこつこつと積み重ねてきた事を\n無駄だったと後悔したくないので\n前だけを見る"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よくしっかりしてるねと言われるけど\n本当はかなり恥ずかしがり屋で\nこの部分を隠すのについ肩に\n力を入れてしまう癖があるので\n改善していきたいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2017/01/05/1832617/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2017年も宜しくお願いします"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1月誕生日の方、教えてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また見てね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛"}],"source":"archive"}